 ParkMate — Security and QA Checks

- [ ] A user cannot view another user's private booking information.
- [ ] A provider cannot edit another provider's listing.
- [ ] Only authorized reviewers can approve listings.
- [ ] Unapproved listings cannot be booked.
- [ ] Invalid dates and unavailable time slots are rejected.
- [ ] Overlapping bookings cannot both be confirmed.
- [ ] Secrets are kept out of frontend code and GitHub.
- [ ] Logout ends access to protected pages and actions.
- [ ] Server and database permissions are enforced, not just hidden in the UI.

Record each test's result and any failure. These are tests to perform, not claims that security has already been verified.
